# quest set available again by a GM, the skill back to 0). Shield 357 (a Warrior's Shield cap at 96 is 357, but Shield
# is not in the list): the default. Then each of the Warrior's other listed skills alone at 357 (Dagger, Sword, Great
# Sword, Axe, Scythe, Polearm, Club, Staff): 10196 each. Accepted (a GM), 15 merit points, no skill: no section, the
# default; Axe 357: progressEvent 10198, finished: completed (merits 0).
